, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]leave the Haircut row to bob-cli-iz.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make block-ID renames one undo step and undo-coherent across [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]notes[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]rename_atomic[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rename_atomic: reproduce the split undo in real Obsidian, apply each [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note's rename edits as one editor transaction, write closed notes with a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compare-and-swap, and follow an undone rename across notes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop Keep links from seeding block IDs[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]keep_ids[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keep_ids: find the writer that mints ^https-keep-google-com IDs for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Keep-linked tasks and make it mint from the task's prose.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]vault-sync task-loss tripwire[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]loss_tripwire[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]loss_tripwire: before each commit, find task block IDs this host removed[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that inbound links still need, or open tasks that vanished; confirm [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after a settle window, then record, log, and notify without editing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notes.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-j0","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-j0.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d1024736c3ba97d4315b9f9177de85bd","started_at":"2026-11-09T12:45:14.126609+0